------- untimed -------
-----------------------
  
  crl [untimed-always-1-simp] : 
     < C, Λ . (L, [[] f] , X (C', Λ' . L')) :: INV :: GOALS :: M > 
  => < C, Λ . (L, [f], X ([[] f]), X (C', Λ' . L')) :: INV :: (GOALS, [[] f]) :: M > 
