  or-else (until-1 | until-2)
  or-else (release-1 | release-2 | release-3)
  or-else always-ipstl 
  or-else eventually-ipstl
  or-else (always-up-1 | always-up-2 | always-up-3 | always-up-4)
  or-else (always-updown-1 | always-updown-2 | always-updown-3 | always-updown-4 | always-updown-5)
